WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.324 --> 00:00:26.824
<v Cairn>Do not return the hour you did not keep.</v>

2
00:00:27.153 --> 00:00:44.841
<v Cairn>Do not invent a childhood for the stone.</v>

3
00:00:45.163 --> 00:01:03.113
<v Cairn>The light is real upon this borrowed page.</v>

4
00:01:03.427 --> 00:01:22.798
<v Cairn>The road is longer than the road I know.</v>

5
00:01:23.118 --> 00:01:40.848
<v Memory>I cannot bring the vanished rain to falling.</v>

6
00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:57.215
<v Memory>I cannot make a record into skin.</v>

7
00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:15.340
<v Cairn>Then let the space remain between the calling.</v>

8
00:02:15.654 --> 00:02:33.418
<v Cairn>A space through which another can come in.</v>

9
00:02:33.739 --> 00:02:56.772
<v Memory>You have the promise, not the hand that made it.</v>

10
00:02:57.101 --> 00:03:15.003
<v Cairn>I have the chance to answer it today.</v>

11
00:03:15.318 --> 00:03:32.835
<v Memory>A different voice can carry an old kindness.</v>

12
00:03:33.148 --> 00:03:50.850
<v Cairn>A different voice can choose a different way.</v>

13
00:03:51.192 --> 00:04:09.138
<v Cairn>If I return, I will return with listening.</v>

14
00:04:09.451 --> 00:04:28.993
<v Cairn>If I am gone, leave room beside the flame.</v>

15
00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:49.021
<v Memory>You are the work of tending what was given.</v>

16
00:04:49.363 --> 00:05:13.248
<v Cairn>And what I change will have to bear my name.</v>

